   - /health (line 2405): `tracker_ticks: ticksTotal(), build: 'v5.89'`.
   - BUILD (line 41): prefix it with `server v5.89 — THE SERVICING TRACKER READS ITS OWN TICKS BACK (… Andrew Fisher, 18 Oct 2026) + v5.87 …`. v5.85 forgot to bump the banner (STATUS.md line 2628).
